        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forks_of_Salmon%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Over 98% of surrounding land is national forest managed by the U.S. Forest Service.",
